# Architecture Principles

- Prefer modular architecture.
- Separate UI, application logic and infrastructure.
- Keep domain logic independent from Tauri whenever possible.
- Avoid tight coupling between frontend and backend.
- Use explicit interfaces between modules.
- Avoid circular dependencies.
- Prefer composition over unnecessary inheritance-like abstractions.
- Keep the application extensible without premature abstraction.